@AstralPath.Api_HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5190

### 就绪探针
GET {{AstralPath.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### 接口元信息
GET {{AstralPath.Api_HostAddress}}/api/meta
Accept: application/json

### 演示学生列表
GET {{AstralPath.Api_HostAddress}}/api/demo/students
Accept: application/json

### 知识债诊断（王小明 · 预埋红边）
POST {{AstralPath.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/students/demo-student-a/diagnose?graph_ver=1
Accept: application/json

### 图谱视图
GET {{AstralPath.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/students/demo-student-a/graph-view?graph_ver=1
Accept: application/json

### 今日任务
POST {{AstralPath.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/students/demo-student-a/today
Accept: application/json

### 教师端热点（默认仅可见已授权学生）
GET {{AstralPath.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/teachers/demo-teacher/hotspots
Accept: application/json
